<view class="page"><view class="title">维修履历</view><view class="mini-item"><view class="mini-art"><art src="{{item.photo}}" kind="{{item.art}}"/></view><view><view class="inline-name">{{item.name}}</view><view class="small muted">{{item.dayText}}</view></view></view><view class="note">共计 {{records.length}}次 · 累计 ¥{{total}}</view><view wx:for="{{records}}" wx:key="id" class="timeline" bindtap="edit" data-id="{{item.id}}"><view class="row"><text class="small muted">{{item.date}}</text><text class="link">编辑 ›</text></view><view class="section-title">{{item.problem}}</view><view class="body-copy small">{{item.treatment}}</view><view class="green">{{item.costText}}</view><view class="small muted body-copy">{{item.note}}</view><view class="photo-list"><image wx:for="{{item.photos}}" wx:for-item="photo" wx:key="*this" class="photo-cell" src="{{photo}}" mode="aspectFill"/></view></view><view wx:if="{{!records.length}}" class="empty">还没有维修记录<view class="hint">如果它以后坏了、修过，<view class="line-break"/>可以把这些经历留在这里。</view></view><button class="primary section" bindtap="add">＋ 记录维修</button></view>
